# AWeber: Email Marketing & Automation for Small Businesses

> AWeber is an email marketing and automation platform founded in 1998, trusted by small businesses, creators, coaches, bloggers, and entrepreneurs. AWeber provides tools to grow email lists, send newsletters, automate email workflows, build landing pages, and sell products. AWeber offers 24/7 customer support and free account migration from other platforms.

- Primary domain: aweber.com

